{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dearest public, welcome to the feline circus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AnimaCircus, the player gets into a circus troupe made out exclusively by cats, performing to a human audience excited to see your tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the keyboard keys or controller buttons, press the direction shown on-screen at the right time to guarantee the best show possible. But don\u2019t worry if you get it wrong, the spectators are very comprehensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 20 songs composed especially for this show and pick the difficulty that better suits you;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the set come to life as you get many notes consecutively;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your avatar, picking their skin and eyes color, as well your best clothes.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590590?t=1759517439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/16e3659c9e20e7d6d4fab903aeeaad52f85dc893/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759517439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/a830130bb4e2df32b791c1c9009acef7ac0839a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759517439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/a830130bb4e2df32b791c1c9009acef7ac0839a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759517439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3741520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dearest public, welcome to the feline circus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p